<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-12T20:59:02.015Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:59:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has expanded its presence in southern Lebanon by building new road networks and opening bases, while continuing strikes on Qantara, overflights that wounded a Lebanese footballer and the detention of a 65‑year-old retired engineer. Hezbollah has arrested five members in Batroun, maintained artillery fire on Israeli positions and begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Former Iraqi MP Ahmed al-Alwani was found dead in Beirut, prompting a probe by France into alleged Israeli war crimes. UN peacekeepers are preparing to exit Lebanon as displaced families face devastation, and Israel’s actions are disrupting ecosystems, including Lebanon’s wheat crop. 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOSzBYVTZaWEE5UlVZVlFscjNtUkFERXhGcEtUdEdSN2V6THd6cGszaHVxNUgzT2RxcGNWU296VS16T2Q1Q0ltWUt0eDBfVTRaMW5WdWVBY0RRYnlVZFg4RnotVkFKODhOUTBMMUJSY2V3UGFibVpCci1qNk5qdHk5QTVNb0JUbHlJenI1NG9KMEpYWUNZX1gzMjY2dk8xT1NLTk82Smh1Z3lQalp6bDlpOF9UdGptU3JhUnZtSUQ3aHl1cHFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE54R1pweUMtN1M4c0dTQ3NCLTQyUFFpWTVVeXZ5ZGhqUlNtSE9PV0xqWHBrTXRhOEwtaXU5aXdXd09KVmt0cXZ0Y2FVdjdCY0NLci0zS01lQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
